    "body": "## Summary\n- add an optional map-based center point and 1–100 km radius when saving discovery presets\n- reuse the existing location picker while sending only coordinates + radius to the saved-search API\n- show configured radius in `/saved-searches` without rendering stored coordinates\n- preserve `latitude`, `longitude` and `radiusKm` when toggling alerts so replace-style updates cannot erase location criteria\n- document the frontend privacy boundary and update semantics\n\n## Privacy / safety\n- address/public labels used by the picker are not sent as saved-search data\n- private center coordinates stay behind the authenticated saved-search API\n- shareable discovery URLs still contain public filters only\n- notification bodies and participant-only tracking/location data remain unchanged\n\n## Validation\nRun frontend lint/build plus the existing API, Flyway/PostGIS runtime and payments-ledger gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
